#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.2"
msgstr "v4.1.2"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.2 adds advanced pixel formats with full debayering, YUV image "
"processing, a new :mod:`imu` module (LSM6DSOX), DFSDM digital-microphone "
"audio, and FrogEye2020 event-sensor support. ``erode()``/``dilate()`` "
"behavior and the desktop RPC library changed — read the breaking changes "
"below."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.2 lägger till avancerade pixelformat med fullständig debayering, YUV-"
"bildbehandling, en ny :mod:`imu`\\ -modul (LSM6DSOX), DFSDM digital-"
"mikrofonsljud och stöd för FrogEye2020-händelsesensorn. Beteendet för "
"``erode()``\\ /\\ ``dilate()`` och skrivbordets RPC-bibliotek ändrades — läs"
" de brytande ändringarna nedan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "På den här sidan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Höjdpunkter"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:19
msgid "**Advanced pixel formats** with **full debayering** support."
msgstr "**Avancerade pixelformat** med stöd för **fullständig debayering**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:20
msgid "**YUV image processing.**"
msgstr "**YUV-bildbehandling.**"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:21
msgid ""
"New :mod:`imu` module — LSM6DSOX support (configurable orientation, MLC)."
msgstr ""
"Ny :mod:`imu`\\ -modul — stöd för LSM6DSOX (konfigurerbar orientering, MLC)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:22
msgid "**DFSDM audio** — digital-microphone input."
msgstr "**DFSDM-ljud** — ingång för digital mikrofon."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:23
msgid "**FrogEye2020** event-sensor support."
msgstr "Stöd för **FrogEye2020**\\ -händelsesensorn."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** ``erode()``/``dilate()`` now operate on non-white pixels and a"
" desktop RPC class was renamed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Brytande:** ``erode()``\\ /\\ ``dilate()`` opererar nu på icke-vita pixlar"
" och en RPC-klass för skrivbordet döptes om — se de brytande ändringarna."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:28
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nya funktioner"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Advanced pixel formats** — new pixel-format handling with **full "
"debayering** support (Bayer → RGB/grayscale across formats)."
msgstr ""
"**Avancerade pixelformat** — ny hantering av pixelformat med stöd för "
"**fullständig debayering** (Bayer → RGB/gråskala över format)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:32
msgid "**YUV image processing** — added YUV image-processing support."
msgstr "**YUV-bildbehandling** — lade till stöd för YUV-bildbehandling."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:33
msgid ""
":mod:`imu` module — a new IMU module with the LSM6DSOX driver, configurable "
"IMU orientation, and machine-learning-core (MLC) support."
msgstr ""
":mod:`imu`\\ -modul — en ny IMU-modul med LSM6DSOX-drivrutinen, "
"konfigurerbar IMU-orientering och stöd för machine-learning-core (MLC)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Audio** — added DFSDM digital-microphone support to the :mod:`audio` "
"module."
msgstr ""
"**Ljud** — lade till stöd för DFSDM digital mikrofon i :mod:`audio`\\ "
"-modulen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:36
msgid ""
"**FrogEye2020** — new FrogEye2020 event-sensor driver, with event-camera "
"example scripts."
msgstr ""
"**FrogEye2020** — ny FrogEye2020-drivrutin för händelsesensor, med "
"exempelskript för händelsekameror."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:40
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Övriga ändringar och förbättringar"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:42
#, python-format
msgid "Software JPEG encoding is ~10 % faster (improved bit handling)."
msgstr ""
"Programvarubaserad JPEG-kodning är ~10 % snabbare (förbättrad bithantering)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:43
msgid ":class:`machine.I2C` now uses the hardware I2C peripheral on STM32 H7."
msgstr ""
":class:`machine.I2C` använder nu hårdvarans I2C-kringutrustning på STM32 H7."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:44
msgid ""
"``find_apriltags()``, ``find_line_segments()``, and the TensorFlow input "
"path were moved onto the unified ``draw_image`` backend."
msgstr ""
"``find_apriltags()``\\ , ``find_line_segments()`` och TensorFlow-indatavägen"
" flyttades till den enhetliga ``draw_image``\\ -backenden."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:48
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Buggfixar"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:50
msgid ""
"Fixed software-JPEG-encoding overflow situations, :mod:`image` ``compress``,"
" and the ``IS_JPEG`` format detection."
msgstr ""
"Åtgärdade överflödessituationer vid programvarubaserad JPEG-kodning, "
":mod:`image` ``compress`` och ``IS_JPEG``\\ -formatdetekteringen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:54
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hårdvaru- och kortstöd"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:56
msgid "**FrogEye2020** event sensor."
msgstr "**FrogEye2020**\\ -händelsesensor."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:57
msgid "**Arduino Nicla Vision (BORMIO)** — updated pinout and USB VID/PID."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Nicla Vision (BORMIO)** — uppdaterad stiftkonfiguration och USB "
"VID/PID."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:58
msgid "**Arduino Portenta H7** — default sensor clock set to 12 MHz."
msgstr "**Arduino Portenta H7** — standardsensorklocka satt till 12 MHz."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:61
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Brytande API-ändringar"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:63
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v4.1.1 and v4.1.2. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Användarsynliga API-brytningar mellan v4.1.1 och v4.1.2. Omfattning: Python "
"C-moduler i ``modules/`` och Python-bibliotek i ``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:66
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Varje ändring är märkt med sin påverkan:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:68
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; host-side tooling only."
msgstr "*minor* — smalt API; endast verktyg på värdsidan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:69
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — samma API, andra resultat; kontrollera finjusterade skript "
"igen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:71
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. Each commit hash links to its "
"diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Ändringarna är grupperade efter påverkan i den ordningen. Varje commit-hash "
"länkar till sin diff på GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:77
msgid "Desktop RPC library class renamed *(minor)*"
msgstr "RPC-biblioteksklass för skrivbordet omdöpt *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:79
msgid ""
"In the host-side desktop RPC library (``tools/rpc/rpc.py``), the "
"``rpc_wifi_or_ethernet_master`` class was renamed to ``rpc_network_master``,"
" and the RTSP/RPC host scripts were switched to use the standard network "
"libraries. This affects host-PC programs only; on-camera scripts are "
"unaffected."
msgstr ""
"I RPC-biblioteket för skrivbordet på värdsidan (\\ ``tools/rpc/rpc.py``\\ ) "
"döptes klassen ``rpc_wifi_or_ethernet_master`` om till "
"``rpc_network_master``\\ , och RTSP-/RPC-värdskripten ställdes om till att "
"använda standardnätverksbiblioteken. Detta påverkar endast program på värd-"
"PC:n; skript på kameran påverkas inte."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:85
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `a2f016ba0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a2f016ba0>`__, `a4858015c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a4858015c>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `a2f016ba0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a2f016ba0>`__\\ , `a4858015c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a4858015c>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:91
msgid "``erode()`` / ``dilate()`` operate on non-white pixels *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``erode()`` / ``dilate()`` opererar på icke-vita pixlar *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:93
msgid ""
"``Image.erode()`` and ``Image.dilate()`` were fixed to operate on non-white "
"pixels instead of only white pixels. Results differ from previous releases "
"for non-binary / non-white-only images — re-check tuned morphology "
"pipelines."
msgstr ""
"``Image.erode()`` och ``Image.dilate()`` åtgärdades så att de opererar på "
"icke-vita pixlar istället för endast vita pixlar. Resultaten skiljer sig "
"från tidigare versioner för icke-binära / icke-enbart-vita bilder — "
"kontrollera finjusterade morfologipipelines igen."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:97
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `899f80759 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/899f80759>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `899f80759 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/899f80759>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:100
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migreringschecklista"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.2.rst:102
msgid ""
"For a clean port to v4.1.2: in host-PC RPC programs, rename "
"``rpc_wifi_or_ethernet_master`` to ``rpc_network_master`` (:ref:`the RPC "
"rename <v4_1_2_rpc>`), and re-check any ``erode()`` / ``dilate()`` results "
"on non-binary images (:ref:`the morphology change <v4_1_2_morph>`). On-"
"camera scripts otherwise run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"För en ren portering till v4.1.2: i RPC-program på värd-PC:n, döp om "
"``rpc_wifi_or_ethernet_master`` till ``rpc_network_master`` (\\ :ref:`RPC-"
"omdöpningen <v4_1_2_rpc>`\\ ), och kontrollera eventuella ``erode()`` / "
"``dilate()``\\ -resultat på icke-binära bilder igen (\\ "
":ref:`morfologiändringen <v4_1_2_morph>`\\ ). Skript på kameran körs i "
"övrigt oförändrade."
